@startuml
title D-06 Manual Release Governance Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Operator
actor Supervisor
participant "Operator Console" as Console
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Approved Manual Emergency Process" as Manual
participant "Reconciliation Workflow" as Recon
participant "Gate / Exit System" as Gate

Operator -> Console : request manual release review
Console -> Central : retrieve session, payment,\nfiscal, authorization state
Central --> Console : context and restrictions
Supervisor -> Console : approve / reject where policy allows
alt approved formal emergency process
  Console -> Manual : record reason, incident,\naudit, reconciliation tags
  Manual -> Gate : controlled release if assigned by policy
  Manual -> Recon : create reconciliation item
else not approved
  Console --> Operator : release denied / continue escalation
end

note over Console
Manual release is last resort.
Console does not silently convert it
to payment finality or normal ExitAuthorization.
end note

@enduml
